<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\なつみ春花大の字.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ahh, somehow that made me even more tired..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, seriously..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We went back to the second-floor room, and I lay down on the tatami with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> still hadn't come back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe I should go rescue her after all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But in its own way, that is a welcome, so we can't exactly brush them off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey... do you think we should rescue <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... dunno..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Thought so."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah..."</STYLE><BR>
"Haah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I performed a chorus of sighs.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, hey, was <STYLE ID="4">your dad</STYLE> someone like <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... they look alike, but personality-wise they're totally different... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was more the type who seemed timid and unreliable at first glance, according to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s smart and confident, and he's really respected in the settlement too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm. 
{PAUSE ""}
What about <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>'s wife?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s wife died 10 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently it was an accident, she fell off a cliff in the mountains."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see. Then <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> too, must be lonely."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's why, with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> and the rest of you here, they're probably extra worked up. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> included."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then we really can't brush them off..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Still, they're getting way too carried away. Especially since </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s popular, for better or worse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Popular, or... more like a toy?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"For real."</STYLE><PG>
"Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> jumped down from the cherry tree earlier, right? Can <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and the others do that too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, she can probably still do it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> lived here too, until she went to college. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, those sisters are the only ones who can do stuff like that. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could never pull it off."</STYLE><PG>
"Yeah, I can't picture it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it's a small settlement, but they seem to have their own division of roles."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Division of roles?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s what you'd call the brains, I guess. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s assistant, more or less, and the others go out hunting and such. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There are a lot of pretty rare animals around here. Maybe they'll be on the table tonight."</STYLE><PG>
"Wow! So it's that 'local food, eaten locally' thing! What kind of stuff will we get?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's all super tasty! It'll probably cure </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s worn-out look too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Maybe it's about time I went to rescue her..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Guess there's no helping it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, I was helping get dinner ready, and I snuck off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Let's go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Together we called out "Heave-ho" and got up.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I headed to the big room on the first floor.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Lively voices were spilling out into the hallway.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="10">"So-</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="10">o-</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="10">ooo!</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　The reason I'm not popular is that men have no eye for quality!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's right, that's right! I won't stand for any man who finds fault with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">my daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're so cool!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Just strip every guy by force, tie them up, and jump them!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\天然ボケにご用心.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">A strange conversation was echoing down the hallway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It had to be the father and daughters from before, but they seemed different from earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Especially </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s voice. She sounded like a different person.</STYLE><PG>
"It's... safe to go in, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't guarantee your safety..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Roger..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I opened the door, four figures were gathered around the dining table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">One seemed to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but the look in her eyes was different from before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> were drinking the sake I'd brought, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was drinking juice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And the last figure was...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ぐったり.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kneeling formally in front of the table, with a face that didn't have even the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">L</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of "life" in it, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\glass-ice1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\酒のコップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And in her hand, a cup.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others were drinking something that looked the same, but surely not...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that's alcohol!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hurriedly snatched </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s cup away and studied it closely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, no sign she drank any..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> stayed frozen in her cup-holding pose, motionless as an empty shell.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No... looking closely, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s mouth was moving slightly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She seemed to be saying something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, what's wrong? Are you okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I brought my ear close to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s mouth.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="みさお">Virtue</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">my purity... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">chastity... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">modesty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her pupils fully dilated, she kept repeating it to herself like a broken record.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you idiot sisters over there! What did you do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> raised her voice at the idiot sisters.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"Whaaat? We juuust asked </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> a whooole bunch of questions, that's aaall?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPN>　Ahahahahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah, yeah! Questions, questions!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Questions alone wouldn't break </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> this badly!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You did this and that to her, didn't you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, 'this and that'... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">like what, specifically?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Explain it with examples, so even an elementary schooler can understand!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...! You little </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Huuuh? You can't say?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Or do you not know anything, at your age?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shut up! Believe it or not, I actually pay attention in class!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Whoa! Schools in Motoki-cho teach stuff like that too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　So, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">so, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">do they have hands-on learning and stuff?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course they don't, you damn </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"Nooow, now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, both of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> were juuust having a contest over which of us could name more good things about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, riiight in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, that's aaall?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPN>"Yeah, yeah! At the end, we had a contest over who could guess </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s boob size more accurately just by palpation!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s been like this the whole time and won't tell us the right answer."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That palpation is totally the reason!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, snap out of it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hey!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
