<STYLE ID="2">It was the opposite.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A vivid aroma burst in my mouth, so good it seemed not of this world, and the savory flavor of the meat soaked into every single cell of my mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And at this </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ほうじゅん">rich</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> fragrance rising into my nose, my </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="びこう">nasal passages</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sighed in rapture, and the walls of my esophagus danced a delightful dance of joy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Trembling all over, I got up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It's delicious... way too delicious...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Unbelievable! I'd believed salmon roe sushi was the ultimate, but this was a shock that easily overturned that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's so delicious it made me faint!</STYLE><PG>
