{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, life was rapidly returning to her haggard face, and she had her usual </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> expression again.</STYLE>
