{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hah hah hah! You thought we were feeding you some awful weird food, but one bite and you got surprised all over again, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes! I've never eaten anything this delicious!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
